        "text": "\"Create query_documents.py in the current working directory.\nTask: queries documents by a field value or partition-style key.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc1a0f6a001pzf4Ey7Bvn1JJt",
